Tech Stack
Frontend: Next.js (App Router) + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui
Backend: FastAPI
Database: SQLite initially (course.db)
State: Zustand
API: Axios + React Query
AI: Gemini/OpenAI-compatible APIs
Authentication: User login with persistent progress

//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

Mandatory Features
1. User Authentication
Register/Login
Secure authentication
Each user has their own courses and progress
2. PDF Upload
Upload one or more PDF files
Validate file type and size
Store uploaded PDFs
3. PDF Text Extraction
Extract text from PDFs
Handle large documents
Clean and preprocess extracted text
4. AI Course Generation

After uploading a PDF, automatically generate:

Course title
Course description
Modules/chapters
Lessons
Learning objectives
Summary
5. Course Viewer

A clean UI where users can:

Browse modules
Read lessons
Navigate between lessons
View generated content
6. Learning Progress
Mark lessons as completed
Save progress in the database
Resume later from where the user left off
Show completion percentage
7. AI Chatbot (RAG)

The chatbot should answer questions only from the uploaded PDF/course by:

Retrieving relevant document chunks
Sending retrieved context to the LLM
Providing contextual answers instead of hallucinating
8. Quiz Generation
 ai prompt choice 
Generate quizzes from the course:
based on context
Multiple Choice Questions
Correct answers
Optional explanations
Score calculation
